OL,3,ANigeria mourns as 32 killed in military
OL,4,Aplane crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigeria's President Bola Tinubu has
OL,7,Fdeclared three days of national
OL,8,Fmourning after a military aircraft
OL,9,Fcrashed in southern Ondo State, killing
OL,10,F32 people.
OL,12,FAuthorities say the plane was on a
OL,13,Froutine mission from Benin City to
OL,14,FLagos when it came down near a naval
OL,15,Fbase on Monday morning.
OL,17,FA resident told the BBC that the plane
OL,18,Fhad crashed near a swamp and that
OL,19,Fclothes and shoes had been found at the
OL,20,Fsite. Smoke could be seen rising from
OL,21,Fthe area.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
