OL,3,ANigeria mourns as 32 killed in military
OL,4,Aplane crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FTinubu offered his deepest condolences
OL,7,Ffor the 25 passengers and seven crew
OL,8,Fmembers on board and has ordered a full
OL,9,Finvestigation.
